  "slug": "surface-area-of-3d-shapes",
  "title": "三维形体的表面积",
  "status": "published",
  "qualityGate": "tested",
  "batch": "batch-012",
  "studyTags": [
    "数组",
    "数学",
    "矩阵"
  ],
  "summary": "网格每格堆叠若干单位立方体，求组合形体暴露在外的总表面积。",
  "insight": "高度 h 的独立柱贡献 4h+2；与上方和左方相邻柱每重叠一层会遮住两个面，减去 2·min(height1,height2)。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "高度零的柱没有顶底面",
    "每对相邻柱只处理一次",
    "上下左右四面通过两方向邻接扣减即可"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "column-surfaces-minus-shared-faces",
      "title": "柱体表面减共享面",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "逐格加入独立柱面积并扣除已扫描邻居重合面。",
      "steps": [
        "对 h>0 加 4*h+2",
        "若 row>0，减 2*min(h,grid[row-1][column])",
        "若 column>0，对左邻同样扣减；返回总和"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n²)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/column-surfaces-minus-shared-faces/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/column-surfaces-minus-shared-faces/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/column-surfaces-minus-shared-faces/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
